1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:01,950
Watch one frame change shape.

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:03,560
A frame can be wide,

3
00:00:03,670 --> 00:00:04,820
like a cinema screen.

4
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:06,220
Or it can be tall,

5
00:00:06,330 --> 00:00:07,730
like a phone held in one

6
00:00:07,730 --> 00:00:08,330
hand.

7
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:10,115
The same numbers fit both shapes,

8
00:00:10,115 --> 00:00:11,480
so we hold still and let

9
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:12,130
you read them.

10
00:00:12,570 --> 00:00:14,110
Same frame, two shapes.
